[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CRYPTO]
Bitecoin

[en.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CRYPTO_desc]
“What is Bitecoin?”\n§g“They are a type of digital money. But instead of being controlled by a central government, they are decentralized using magichain technology.”§!\n“Okay, but what is Bitecoin?”\n§g“Well it was created in 1002, and has a circulating supply of 117 billion coins, of which, 113 billion have already been mined.”§!\n“Cool... so what is Bitecoin?”\n§g“Like I said, it is a digital currency.”§!\n“My question is — what is Bitecoin?”\n§g“I’m glad you asked! It’s the future of currency, it’s an unstoppable financial pickle that is going to take over the world!”§!\n“But what is it?”

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CRYPTO]
傻币

[zh.FOCUS_C07_LPGG_CRYPTO_desc]
“什么是傻币？”\n§g“它们是一种数字货币。但是，它们不是由中央政府控制的，而是使用魔法链技术去中心化。”§!\n“好吧，但是傻币是什么？”\n§g“它是在1002年创造的，流通供应量为1170亿枚，其中1130亿枚已经被挖掘出来。”§!\n“很酷...那傻币是什么？”\n§g“就像我说的，它是一种数字货币。”§!\n“我的问题是——傻币是什么？”\n§g“我很高兴你问！它是货币的未来，是一种不可阻挡的金融工具，将风靡世界！”§!\n“但它到底是什么？”

